{% doc %}
  Emits the site-wide WebSite JSON-LD node.

  Rendered only from `structured-data.liquid`, and only on the homepage. Like the
  Organization node, the `@id` is derived from `shop.url` so it is stable across
  the live theme, preview themes, and the `*.myshopify.com` host.

  No `potentialAction` / `SearchAction`. Google deprecated the sitelinks search box
  on 2024-10-21 and retired it globally on 2024-11-21, so the markup has no effect
  in Google Search. This node is retained as the graph anchor that `publisher`
  points at, and for non-Google consumers.

  @example
    {% render 'structured-data-website' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign website_id = shop.url | append: '/#website'
  assign org_id = shop.url | append: '/#organization'
-%}

<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "@id": {{ website_id | json }},
    "name": {{ shop.name | json }},
    "url": {{ shop.url | json }},
    "inLanguage": {{ request.locale.iso_code | json }},
    "publisher": {
      "@id": {{ org_id | json }}
    }
  }
</script>
